            "tab_id": "returns",
            "tab_content": "<div class=\"prose\">\n    <div class=\"highlight\"><p>We stand behind every product we make. If something isn't working for you, contact us within 30 days of delivery and we'll make it right.</p></div>\n    <h3>Our 30-Day Satisfaction Guarantee</h3>\n    <p>If you are not satisfied with your purchase for any reason, contact us at  within 30 days of your delivery date. We will issue a refund to your original payment method once your request has been reviewed. We want every customer to feel confident buying from us — if something didn't work, we own that.</p>\n    <h3>Eligibility</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Refund requests must be submitted within 30 days of the confirmed delivery date</li>\n      <li>Product must have been purchased directly from phasisevo.com</li>\n      <li>Limit of one refund per product per customer</li>\n      <li>Refunds are issued to the original payment method only</li>\n      <li>We reserve the right to decline requests that show clear signs of misuse or abuse of this policy</li>\n    </ul>\n    <h3>How to Request a Refund</h3>\n    <p>Email  with your order number and a brief reason for your request. You do not need to return the product. We process all requests within 3 business days. Refunds typically appear on your statement within 5–10 business days.</p>\n    <h3>Damaged or Incorrect Orders</h3>\n    <p>If your order arrives damaged or incorrect, contact us within 7 days with your order number and a photo. We will send a replacement or issue a full refund — your choice.</p>\n    <h3>Items Not Received</h3>\n    <p>If tracking</p>\n</div>",
